# hacienda .dockerignore
target/
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*
*.md
# Deliberately no `*.toml`/`*.lock` line here (unlike the rest of this file's blanket
# extension excludes): every crate's Cargo.toml plus the workspace Cargo.lock must
# survive into the build context, or `cargo chef prepare`/`cargo build` fail with
# "could not find Cargo.toml in /app or any parent directory". A previous version of
# this file excluded them unconditionally (Cargo.toml is itself a `.toml` file), which
# meant no Dockerfile in this repo could ever have produced a working build.
# `config/production.toml` (COPY'd separately into the runtime stage) needs the same
# exception for the same reason - it would otherwise silently be an empty COPY.
*.json
*.yaml
*.yml
*.sh
*.ps1
*.bat
*.cmd
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
